{%- comment -%}
  The seven fixed-price bundles from the Pricing & Offers spec (prices live on the Shopify bundle products).
  Returns a pipe string for a handle: "steps|badge|place|kind", e.g. "1,2,3,4|bts_pick|featured-1|ritual".
  steps: routine steps in the box (repeats = units) · place: featured-N (home + shop), sets (bundles page),
  pdp-2 / pdp-4 (stock-ups, only on that step's product page).
  Usage: {% capture def %}{% render 'bundle-def', handle: product.handle %}{% endcapture %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- case handle -%}
  {%- when 'the-full-ritual' -%}1,2,3,4|bts_pick|featured-1|ritual
  {%- when 'the-clear-protect-trio' -%}1,2,4||featured-2|trio
  {%- when 'clear-protect-duo' -%}2,4|daily_essential|featured-3|duo
  {%- when 'the-night-ritual' -%}1,2,3||sets|ritual
  {%- when 'the-core-duo' -%}1,2||sets|duo
  {%- when 'spf-stock-up' -%}4,4||pdp-4|stock
  {%- when 'serum-stock-up' -%}2,2||pdp-2|stock
{%- endcase -%}
